\item[S2] W. K. Hayman and E. F. Lingham, Research Problems in Function Theory (2018), arXiv:1809.07200, Chapter 5, Problem 5.27, its update and the preceding shared notation. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07200}.
